DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270806
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270807
SUMMARY:Panigiri of the Transfiguration\, Avlemonas
LOCATION:Avlemonas\, Kythira\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The fishing village of Avlemonas keeps its annual chorós on the evening of 6 August\, feast of the Saviour\, with live music and dancing on the harbour from 9pm and food from the tavernas around it. Small and very pretty\; parking is at the entrance of the village.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/kythira/#avlemonas-panigiri-of-the-transfiguration-avlemonas
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/kythira/#avlemonas-panigiri-of-the-transfiguration-avlemonas
END:VEVENT
