BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:kythira-pitsinianika-panigiri-of-pitsinianika-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270816
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270817
SUMMARY:Panigiri of Pitsinianika
LOCATION:Pitsinianika\, Kythira\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The day after the Dormition the hamlet of Pitsinianika\, between Livadi and Mylopotamos\, fills its little square from 9pm with traditional\, folk and even jazz music\, food and drink\, a raffle\, and the Kythiran circle dance 'apanochoro' danced by everyone. Run by the village association\, 3 euro entry\, one of the friendliest nights on the island.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/kythira/#pitsinianika-panigiri-of-pitsinianika
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/kythira/#pitsinianika-panigiri-of-pitsinianika
END:VEVENT
