BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:kythira-agia-pelagia-panigiri-on-the-eve-of-panagia-myrtidiotissa-ag-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270923
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270925
SUMMARY:Panigiri on the eve of Panagia Myrtidiotissa\, Agia Pelagia
LOCATION:Agia Pelagia\, Kythira\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The evening before the island's great feast of the Myrtidiotissa (24 September) the port village of Agia Pelagia holds its annual chorós on the waterfront from 9pm\, with a live band\, food and dancing\, before everyone drives across to the Myrtidia monastery for the vigil and morning liturgy. Late September is warm and the island is quiet again\; a good weekend to see Kythira as the Kythirans do.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/kythira/#agia-pelagia-panigiri-on-the-eve-of-panagia-myrtidiotissa-ag
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/kythira/#agia-pelagia-panigiri-on-the-eve-of-panagia-myrtidiotissa-ag
END:VEVENT
